Put teammate photos in this folder, then reference them from Students.dc.html and Director.dc.html
(for example: src="assets/members/sumin-cho.jpg").

Recommended filenames (lowercase, hyphenated):
  KanghyunRyu.JPG     Kanghyun Ryu (Director)
  sumin-cho.jpg       Sumin Cho
  yongjun-kim.jpg     Yongjun Kim
  seoa-kim.jpg        Seoa Kim
  yeonjae-jeong.jpg   Yeonjae Jeong
  dongyeop-kang.jpg   Dongyeop Kang
  hyeonjin-goh.jpg    Hyeonjin Goh
  chanyoung-kim.jpg   Chanyoung Kim
  ishita.jpg          Ishita
